{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18270","headline":"酒中留上襄阳李相公 · 韩愈","name":"酒中留上襄阳李相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浊水污泥清路尘，还曾同制掌丝纶。\n眼穿长讶双鱼断，耳热何辞数爵频。\n银烛未销窗送曙，金钗半醉座添春。\n知公不久归钧轴，应许闲官寄病身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}